  <section id="xiphos-bookmark-andbible-import">
    <title>Importing Bookmarks From AndBible</title>
    <p>If you also use <app>AndBible</app> (a Sword-compatible Bible app for
    Android) and want to bring its bookmarks into <app>Biblia Elim</app>, use the
    bookmark import function to read an AndBible bookmarks database file and
    convert it into <app>Biblia Elim</app> bookmarks. Locate the AndBible database
    file (copied from your Android device) when prompted, and the bookmarks it
    contains will be added to your existing <app>Biblia Elim</app> bookmarks.</p>
  </section>

